# Keep the spec site and internal docs OUT of the Vercel application build.
# This guarantees the app never serves PROJECT_SPEC.html as a page and never
# ships internal documents. (.claude/ and CLAUDE.md are gitignored, so they
# never reach Vercel anyway — listed here as defense in depth.)

PROJECT_SPEC.html
PROJECT_SPEC.md
raw_spec.md
docs/internal/

# GitHub Pages workflow is irrelevant to the app deploy
.github/

# AI tooling (belt-and-suspenders; already gitignored)
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
